cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ResearchLens X in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "ResearchLens X: Scientific Research Intelligence Platform"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kumar
    given-names: Pranshu
repository-code: "https://github.com/sudo-pranshu/ResearchLensX"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
abstract: >-
  Evidence-aware scientific literature analysis: PDF ingestion with page provenance, hybrid retrieval, cited
  multi-document question answering, NLI claim verification, a provenance-grounded knowledge graph, candidate
  research gaps and cited literature reviews, with a reproducible evaluation framework on QASPER and SciFact.
keywords:
  - scientific literature
  - information retrieval
  - natural language inference
  - question answering
  - knowledge graph
date-released: "2026-11-14"
version: "0.2.0-dev"
